
sequenceDiagram
    participant S as Student (Browser)
    participant FE as Frontend (React)
    participant BE as Backend (Flask)
    participant DB as SQLite
    
    S->>FE: Load Game
    FE->>BE: GET /api/questions
    BE->>DB: SELECT questions
    DB-->>BE: Return JSON
    BE-->>FE: Return Questions
    FE->>S: Display Intro & Menu
    S->>FE: Start Game
    FE->>FE: Render GameScene
    S->>FE: Select Answer
    FE->>BE: POST /api/submit_answer
    BE->>BE: Validate & Score
    BE-->>FE: Return Result
    FE->>FE: Update Score/State
    FE->>S: Show Feedback/Next Question
    
    participant T as Teacher
    participant Admin as AdminPanel
    T->>Admin: Login
    Admin->>BE: POST /admin/login
    BE-->>Admin: Auth Token
    T->>Admin: Update Question
    Admin->>BE: PUT /api/questions/{id}
    BE->>DB: UPDATE questions
    DB-->>BE: Success
    BE-->>Admin: Confirm Update
